{"html": "<div class=\"mb-8 text-center\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)]\">Markdown Cheat Sheet with Examples</h1><p class=\"mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Free printable PDF plus 40+ elements, each with the syntax beside its live rendered output, and a verified matrix of what works on GitHub, Discord, Obsidian, Slack and Notion. Copy any example in one click.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\"><a class=\"print:hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-[var(--primary)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--primary-foreground)] hover:bg-[var(--primary-hover)] shadow-[0_4px_16px_-4px_var(--primary-glow)]\" download=\"\" href=\"/pdf/markdown-cheat-sheet.pdf\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-download h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12 15V3\"></path><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><path d=\"m7 10 5 5 5-5\"></path></svg>Download PDF (free)</a><a class=\"print:hidden inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)]\" download=\"\" href=\"/img/markdown-cheat-sheet.png\">Download the one-page image</a></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-center text-sm text-[var(--text-muted)]\">No signup, no email. Updated July 2026 — every platform column re-checked against the official documentation.</p><section aria-labelledby=\"try-it-R1thbsnmrb-heading\" class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--surface)] print:hidden mb-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-[var(--border)] px-4 py-3\"><h2 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)]\" id=\"try-it-R1thbsnmrb-heading\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-4 w-4 text-[var(--primary)]\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M5 5a2 2 0 0 1 3.008-1.728l11.997 6.998a2 2 0 0 1 .003 3.458l-12 7A2 2 0 0 1 5 19z\"></path></svg>Try Markdown syntax right here</h2><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><button aria-label=\"Copy MD\" class=\"copy-button print:hidden inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:bg-[var(--surface)] hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\" width=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span>Copy MD</span></button><button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] hover:text-[var(--text-primary)]\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-3.5 w-3.5\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg>Reset</button></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-b border-[var(--border)] px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"self-center text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Load an example</span><button class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" type=\"button\">Table</button><button class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" type=\"button\">Code block</button><button class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" type=\"button\">Task list</button><button class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" type=\"button\">Callouts</button><button class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" type=\"button\">Math &amp; diagrams</button><button class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--background)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[var(--text-secondary)] transition-colors hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\" type=\"button\">Footnotes</button></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"border-b border-[var(--border)] md:border-b-0 md:border-r\"><label class=\"block px-4 pt-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--text-muted)]\" for=\"try-it-R1thbsnmrb-input\">Markdown</label><textarea class=\"h-80 w-full resize-y bg-[var(--background)] px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--text-primary)] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-inset focus:ring-[var(--primary)]\" id=\"try-it-R1thbsnmrb-input\" spellcheck=\"false\"># Markdown Cheat Sheet\n\nEdit anything here and watch the **right-hand pane** update.\n\n- [x] Bold, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~ and `inline code`\n- [ ] Links like [MarkdownTools](https://www.markdowntools.io)\n\n&gt; [!TIP]\n&gt; GitHub-style callouts render here too.\n\n| Element | Syntax |\n| ------- | ------ |\n| Heading | `# Title` |\n| Bold    | `**text**` |\n</textarea></div><div><div class=\"px-4 pt-3 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--text-muted)]\">Rendered output</div><div aria-label=\"Rendered Markdown output\" class=\"h-80 overflow-auto px-4 py-3 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-inset focus:ring-[var(--primary)]\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"markdown-preview\"><div aria-level=\"1\" data-heading-id=\"try-it-R1thbsnmrb-markdown-cheat-sheet\" id=\"try-it-R1thbsnmrb-markdown-cheat-sheet\" role=\"heading\">Markdown Cheat Sheet</div>\n<p>Edit anything here and watch the <strong>right-hand pane</strong> update.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><input aria-label=\"Completed\" checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Bold, <em>italic</em>, <del>strikethrough</del> and <code>inline code</code></li>\n<li><input aria-label=\"Not completed\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"/>Links like <a href=\"https://www.markdowntools.io\">MarkdownTools</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div aria-label=\"TIP callout\" class=\"markdown-callout markdown-callout-tip\" role=\"note\">\n<p class=\"markdown-callout-title\">TIP</p>\n<p>GitHub-style callouts render here too.</p>\n</div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Element</th>\n<th>Syntax</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Heading</td>\n<td><code># Title</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bold</td>\n<td><code>**text**</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div></div></div></div><p class=\"border-t border-[var(--border)] px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)]\">Everything renders in your browser — nothing is uploaded. Need more room?<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--primary)] hover:underline\" href=\"/editor\">Open the full editor</a> <!-- -->or<!-- --> <a class=\"text-[var(--primary)] hover:underline\" href=\"/preview\">the Markdown viewer</a>.</p></section>", "initial": "# Markdown Cheat Sheet\n\nEdit anything here and watch the **right-hand pane** update.\n\n- [x] Bold, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~ and `inline code`\n- [ ] Links like [MarkdownTools](https://www.markdowntools.io)\n\n> [!TIP]\n> GitHub-style callouts render here too.\n\n| Element | Syntax |\n| ------- | ------ |\n| Heading | `# Title` |\n| Bold    | `**text**` |\n"}